<title>HONG KONG: Yue Yuen Industrial shares hit new high.</title>
<headline>Yue Yuen Industrial shares hit new high.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of sports shoe manufacturer Yue Yuen Industrial (Holdings) Ltd leaped in early Thursday trade, the third consecutive day of sharp gains in the share price, following a share consolidation, brokers said.</p>
<p>The share price rose HK$1.20, or 6.78 percent, to a new high of HK$18.90, then eased to close the morning session HK$0.75 higher at HK$18.45. Turnover was very thin at HK$3.21 million.</p>
</text>
